  "summary": "统计正整数 n 能表示为多少种一个或多个连续正整数之和。",
  "insight": "长度 k 的序列首项为 (n-k(k-1)/2)/k；只要分子为正且能整除 k，就对应唯一合法表示。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "首项必须为正",
    "长度上限由 k(k-1)/2<n 决定",
    "长度一始终是一种表示"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "enumerate-sequence-length",
      "title": "枚举连续序列长度",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "检查每个可能长度是否产生正整数首项。",
      "steps": [
        "answer=0，k 从一开始",
        "当 k(k-1)/2<n 时计算 remaining=n-k(k-1)/2",
        "若 remaining%k==0 则 answer++，最终返回"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(sqrt n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/enumerate-sequence-length/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/enumerate-sequence-length/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/enumerate-sequence-length/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
